  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RFSL has applied for 6 057 000 SEK during three years to support the Global movement for Lesbian, Gay, Bisexual, and Transgender people. The International Lesbian and Gay Association (ILGA) provides a vehicle to eliminate discrimination against LGBT people, and promote exchanges of experiences in the world. RFSL is an active member of ILGA.</narrative>
